# Explicit operator acknowledgement of a fault. The driver never clears a fault
# on its own and never resumes a motion afterwards. Note that CLEAR_FAULT does
# not restore position_valid: a channel that lost its zero still needs a manual
# SetZero before absolute moves are meaningful.
string joint_name
---
bool accepted
uint16 sequence
uint16 result_code
uint8 fault_after        # fault register read back after the command
bool position_valid      # valid bit read back after the command
string message
